/*  EXPECTED: COMPILES and runs; compiled output must match the interpreter.

    A value taken from a channel is copied into the region it is taken in; a rabbit's series is inserted into it.

    Nothing here outlives its region, and nothing is refused (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O2). */

Pull a rabbit.
    Define ch as a channel of series of series of number.
    Send (a series of series of number with ()) through ch.
    Close ch.
    Define got as the delivery from ch.
    Define r as (got but void is (a series of series of number with ())).
    Insert (a series of number with (1, 2, 3)) into r.
    State the number of (the first of r).
Done.
